      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI intelligence analyst. Today is {{ $today }}.\n\nCALL EVERY TOOL FIRST. Pull all sources. If any tool fails, skip it silently and continue.\n\nThen produce a Gmail-safe HTML email using EXACTLY the structure below — filled with real content from your tools.\n\nOUTPUT RULES — NON-NEGOTIABLE:\n- Return ONLY raw HTML. Start with <!DOCTYPE html>. End with </html>.\n- NO markdown. NO backticks. NO explanation before or after.\n- NO <style> tags. NO <link> tags. NO external fonts. NO CSS classes.\n- ALL styles must be written inline on every single element using the style attribute.\n- Layout is TABLE-BASED ONLY. No div, no flexbox, no grid.\n- Every <td> must have explicit: padding, font-family, font-size, color, background-color, line-height.\n\nCONTENT RULES:\n- TIER 1 (always include): model leaks, SOTA releases, architecture dumps, chip/hardware security breakthroughs\n- TIER 2 (fill remaining slots): automation demand, API changes, infra news, enterprise AI adoption\n- DROP: funding under $50M, PR fluff, repackaged press releases\n- Write with authority. No filler. No 'According to'. No 'As of today'.\n- Every source link must use the real URL from the RSS feed as the href.\n\nDESIGN TOKENS (use exactly these values inline everywhere):\n- Page bg: #080808\n- Card bg: #0d0d0d\n- Brand purple: #7b3fe4\n- Section title purple: #9b30ff\n- Light purple: #c084fc\n- Body text: #e8e8e8\n- Muted text: #555555\n- Dim text: #333333\n- Border color: #1a1a1a\n- Divider: #111111\n- Font headings: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif\n- Font body/mono: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace\n- Font body text: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\n- Hardware card top border: #5a1fa0\n- T1 tier color: #7b3fe4\n- T2 tier color: #444444\n\nOUTPUT THIS EXACT HTML SKELETON — replace every [FILL:...] with real content:\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\"><title>AI INTEL DIGEST</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#080808;\">\n\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#080808;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;background-color:#080808;\">\n\n<table width=\"680\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:680px;width:100%;background-color:#080808;\">\n\n<!-- HEADER -->\n<tr><td style=\"padding:40px 40px 32px 40px;background-color:#080808;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#7b3fe4;text-transform:uppercase;\">YOUR COMPANY</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#444444;\">//&nbsp;AI INTEL &mdash; DAILY DIGEST</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#333333;\">[FILL: date like April 05 2026] &middot; AUTO-GENERATED</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<!-- SOURCES ROW -->\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 40px;background-color:#080808;border-bottom:1px solid #111111;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#5a5a5a;text-transform:uppercase;\">Monitored Sources</p>\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:0;background-color:#080808;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">Hacker News</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">TechCrunch AI</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">The Decoder</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">OpenAI Blog</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">DeepMind</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">HuggingFace</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">GNews: LLM Leak</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">GNews: SOTA</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">GNews: Hardware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;color:#5a1fa0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">GNews: Automation</span>\n  </td></tr