w',Courier,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#5a5a5a;text-transform:uppercase;\">02 &middot; Technical Breakdown</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#9b30ff;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\">The Deep Dive</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#c0c0c0;line-height:1.85;\">[FILL: Paragraph 1 — what happened and context]</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#c0c0c0;line-height:1.85;\">[FILL: Paragraph 2 — how it happened technically]</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#c0c0c0;line-height:1.85;\">[FILL: Paragraph 3 — implications and what to watch]</p>\n  <a href=\"[FILL: URL]\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#7b3fe4;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #2a1a4a;padding:6px 14px;text-transform:uppercase;\">Read Full Story &rarr;</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<!-- DIVIDER -->\n<tr><td style=\"padding:0 40px;background-color:#080808;\"><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td height=\"1\" style=\"background-color:#2a1a4a;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\n\n<!-- SECTION 03: HARDWARE CORNER -->\n<tr><td style=\"padding:36px 40px;background-color:#080808;border-bottom:1px solid #111111;\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#5a5a5a;text-transform:uppercase;\">03 &middot; Chip &amp; Silicon</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#9b30ff;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\">Hardware / VLSI Corner</p>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"48%\" 